.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Antifonen - weekdagen (catalogus-demo)</title><link>https://orthodox-groningen.github.io/VSA-demo/praktijk/weekdagen/antifonen-weekdagen-catalogus/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://orthodox-groningen.github.io/VSA-demo/praktijk/weekdagen/antifonen-weekdagen-catalogus/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="antifonen---weekdagen">Antifonen - weekdagen&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Liturgische &lt;strong>positie&lt;/strong> (1e / 2e / 3e) × &lt;strong>gelegenheid&lt;/strong> (&lt;code>weekdagen&lt;/code>) = aparte &lt;strong>zangstuk-id&lt;/strong>&amp;rsquo;s.&lt;br>
&lt;strong>Variant&lt;/strong> = &lt;code>liturgikon-weekdagen&lt;/code>. &lt;strong>Uitvoeringsvorm&lt;/strong> = &lt;code>liturgikon&lt;/code> (Liturgikon-tekst) of &lt;code>hemelum&lt;/code> (parochiepraktijk).&lt;/p>
